iv><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Founder &amp; Managing Partner</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Doug Cruikshank is the Founder and Managing Partner of Bergweiss. Prior to founding the firm, he was a Managing Director at Barclays and Lehman Brothers, advising financial sponsor clients. Earlier in his career, he worked in leveraged finance, bank lending, and private placements at Credit Suisse and J.P. Morgan.</p><p>Doug began his career at Manufacturers Hanover Trust Company and holds an A.B. from Princeton University and an M.B.A. from the Kellogg School of Management at Northwestern University.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="team_item w-dyn-item"><div class="team-item_wrap"><div class="team-item_name u-text-style-h6">Rafael Castro</div><div class="team-item_title_contain"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="team-icon"><path d="M0 6.5H6.5M13 6.5H6.5M6.5 6.5V0M6.5 6.5V13" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg><div class="team-item_title u-text-style-main">Partner</div></div></div><div class="team-item_line"></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b549619b8ccdce7d65c4_HarkCapital_Rafeal.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Rafael Castro</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Partner</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Rafael Castro is a Partner at Bergweiss and has been with the firm since its inception. He leads the origination, execution, and portfolio management of the firmâ€™s investments.</p><p>Prior to Bergweiss, Rafael was a Managing Director at Velocity Capital Advisors and previously spent four years at Ableco Finance, managing a $450 million special situations loan portfolio. He also held roles at CIBC World Markets and J.P. Morganâ€™s LabMorgan group.</p><p>Rafael holds an A.B. from Harvard University and an M.B.A. from Columbia Business School.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="team_item w-dyn-item"><div class="team-item_wrap"><div class="team-item_name u-text-style-h6">Rich Davis</div><div class="team-item_title_contain"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="team-icon"><path d="M0 6.5H6.5M13 6.5H6.5M6.5 6.5V0M6.5 6.5V13" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg><div class="team-item_title u-text-style-main">Partner</div></div></div><div class="team-item_line"></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b55b5eed67c14af94598_HarkCapital_Rich.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Rich Davis</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Partner</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Rich Davis is a Partner at Bergweiss and has been with the firm since its inception. He focuses on the origination, execution, and portfolio management of investments.</p><p>Previously, Rich was a Vice President at GarMark Partners, helping deploy a $330 million fund across private debt and equity. He also held roles at Wind Point Partners and RBC Capital Markets.</p><p>Rich holds a B.S. from the University of Illinois, an M.B.A. from the University of Chicago, and is a CFA charterholder.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="team_item w-dyn-item"><div class="team-item_wrap"><div class="team-item_name u-text-style-h6">Ben Lee</div><div class="team-item_title_contain"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="team-icon"><path d="M0 6.5H6.5M13 6.5H6.5M6.5 6.5V0M6.5 6.5V13" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg><div class="team-item_title u-text-style-main">Principal</div></div></div><div class="team-item_line"></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b5671ae34837ba7682c7_HarkCapital_Ben.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Ben Lee</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Principal</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Ben Lee is a Principal at Bergweiss and joined the firm in 2024. He is responsible for the origination, execution, and portfolio management of investments.</p><p>Prior to Bergweiss, Ben was a Director at Silicon Valley Bank and a founding member of the Structured Fund Solutions business, a multi-billion-dollar asset-backed fund financing platform. Earlier in his career, he held roles at Macquarie Group in fund finance in both New York and Sydney.</p><p>Ben holds a BCom (Finance) and a B.A. (Economics) from the University of Sydney.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="team_item w-dyn-item"><div class="team-item_wrap"><div class="team-item_name u-text-style-h6">Peter Wright</div><div class="team-item_title_contain"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="team-icon"><path d="M0 6.5H6.5M13 6.5H6.5M6.5 6.5V0M6.5 6.5V13" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg><div class="team-item_title u-text-style-main">Director</div></div></div><div class="team-item_line"></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b575890850180a395ed9_HarkCapital_Peter.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Peter Wright</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Director</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Peter Wright is a Director at Bergweiss and joined the firm in 2024. He is responsible for investment origination.</p><p>Prior to Bergweiss, Peter was a Vice President at Devon Park Advisors, leading origination, execution, and syndication across a range of secondaries transactions, including LP interest acquisitions, GP-led restructurings, and strategic equity placements. Previously, he was a Senior Associate at Campbell Lutyens and an Associate at Stellex Capital Management.</p><p>Peter holds a B.B.A. from Howard University and an M.B.A. from the University of Chicago.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="team_item w-dyn-item"><div class="team-item_wrap"><div class="team-item_name u-text-style-h6">Diane Moore</div><div class="team-item_title_contain"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="team-icon"><path d="M0 6.5H6.5M13 6.5H6.5M6.5 6.5V0M6.5 6.5V13" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg><div class="team-item_title u-text-style-main">Vice President</div></div></div><div class="team-item_line"></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b59132da23faa82c89d5_HarkCapital_Diane.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Diane Moore</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Vice President</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Diane Moore is a Vice President at Bergweiss and has been with the firm since 2020. She is responsible for execution and portfolio monitoring of Bergweissâ€™s investments.</p><p>Prior to joining Bergweiss, Diane worked on the Exchange-Traded Funds and Product teams at Aberdeen Standard Investments.</p><p>Diane holds a B.A. from Haverford College.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="team_item w-dyn-item"><div class="team-item_wrap"><div class="team-item_name u-text-style-h6">Will Randell</div><div class="team-item_title_contain"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="team-icon"><path d="M0 6.5H6.5M13 6.5H6.5M6.5 6.5V0M6.5 6.5V13" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg><div class="team-item_title u-text-style-main">Vice President</div></div></div><div class="team-item_line"></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b5836100afadf884567a_HarkCapital_Will.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Will Randell</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Vice President</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Will Randell is a Vice President at Bergweiss and has been with the firm since 2022. He is responsible for execution and portfolio monitoring of Bergweissâ€™s investments.</p><p>Prior to joining Bergweiss, Will was an Associate in the Financial Institutions Group at U.S. Bank.</p><p>Will holds a B.A. from Dartmouth College.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="team_item w-dyn-item"><div class="team-item_wrap"><div class="team-item_name u-text-style-h6">Andrew Dunn</div><div class="team-item_title_contain"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="team-icon"><path d="M0 6.5H6.5M13 6.5H6.5M6.5 6.5V0M6.5 6.5V13" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg><div class="team-item_title u-text-style-main">Analyst</div></div></div><div class="team-item_line"></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68f79347e2e97c550bf25a01_HarkCapital_Headshots_AndrewPlaceholder.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Andrew Dunn</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Analyst</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Andrew Dunn is an Analyst at Bergweiss and joined the firm in 2024. He is responsible for execution and portfolio monitoring of Bergweissâ€™s investments.</p><p>Prior to joining Bergweiss, Andrew was an Investment Banking Analyst at PEI Global Partners.</p><p>Andrew holds a B.S. from Georgetown University.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="team_item w-dyn-item"><div class="team-item_wrap"><div class="team-item_name u-text-style-h6">Alex Bockler</div><div class="team-item_title_contain"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="team-icon"><path d="M0 6.5H6.5M13 6.5H6.5M6.5 6.5V0M6.5 6.5V13" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg><div class="team-item_title u-text-style-main">CFO &amp; CCO</div></div></div><div class="team-item_line"></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b5b71c92e36369c01072_HarkCapital_Alex.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Alex Bockler</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">CFO &amp; CCO</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Alex Bockler is the Chief Financial Officer and Chief Compliance Officer of Bergweiss. He is responsible for finance, accounting, tax, operations and compliance across the Bergweiss funds.</p><p>Prior to joining Bergweiss, Alex supported the platform while at Aberdeen Standard Investments. Earlier in his career, he was a Senior Associate in the Private Bank at J.P. Morgan in New York, where he led audits and operations for a range of investment products, including direct private equity funds, fund of funds, and hedge funds. He began his career at BNY Mellon as an accountant for publicly traded 1940 Act funds. </p><p>Alex holds a B.S. from La Salle University.</p><p>â€</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="team_item w-dyn-item"><div class="team-item_wrap"><div class="team-item_name u-text-style-h6">Ronak Patel</div><div class="team-item_title_contain"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="team-icon"><path d="M0 6.5H6.5M13 6.5H6.5M6.5 6.5V0M6.5 6.5V13" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg><div class="team-item_title u-text-style-main">Controller</div></div></div><div class="team-item_line"></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b5c5d7e1408566aba3a2_HarkCapital_Ronak.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Ronak Patel</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Controller</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Ronak Patel is the Controller at Bergweiss and joined the firm in 2023. He is responsible for finance, accounting, tax, and operations across the Bergweiss funds.</p><p>Prior to Bergweiss, Ronak was the Controller at Monachil Capital Partners, where he oversaw finance and operations for the firmâ€™s private debt and â€™40 Act funds. Before that, he served as Head of Finance at Antlerâ€™s U.S. venture fund. Earlier in his career, he held roles at The Beekman Group and SS&amp;C Technologies.</p><p>Ronak holds an M.S. in Accounting and a B.B.A. in Finance from Pace University.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="team_item w-dyn-item"><div class="team-item_wrap"><div class="team-item_name u-text-style-h6">Caitlin Hilmer</div><div class="team-item_title_contain"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="team-icon"><path d="M0 6.5H6.5M13 6.5H6.5M6.5 6.5V0M6.5 6.5V13" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg><div class="team-item_title u-text-style-main">Executive Assistant</div></div></div><div class="team-item_line"></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/6888b10ecd7599e3d3d4064c_Caitlin%20Hilmer.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Caitlin Hilmer</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Executive Assistant</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Caitlin Hilmer is an Executive Assistant at Bergweiss and has been with the firm since 2023. She is responsible for administrative support, coordinating travel, managing team calendars, and assisting with various operational functions.</p><p>Prior to joining Bergweiss, Caitlin managed one of the highest-producing dental practices in Wisconsin for a growing dental services organization, where she developed strong operational and team management skills. Earlier in her career, she was a board-certified veterinary technician, providing care across large, small, and exotic animal practices.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div team-wrapper="" class="mobi-list-wrapper is-mobile w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="leaders-list w-dyn-items"><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="leaders-item w-dyn-item"><div class="leaders-item_wrap"><div class="leaders-img_wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b535fb0c6c0d1599da58_HarkCapital_Doug.avif" alt="" class="leader-img" width="200" height="300"><div class="leaders-icon_wrap is-mobile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="leaders_svg"><path d="M0.5 8H8M15.5 8H8M8 8V0.5M8 8V15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.763158"></path></svg></div></div><div class="leader-item_layout"><div class="leader_top u-text-style-large"><div class="leader-name">Doug Cruikshank</div><div class="leader_title u-text-style-main">Founder &amp; Managing Partner</div></div></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b535fb0c6c0d1599da58_HarkCapital_Doug.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Doug Cruikshank</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Founder &amp; Managing Partner</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Doug Cruikshank is the Founder and Managing Partner of Bergweiss. Prior to founding the firm, he was a Managing Director at Barclays and Lehman Brothers, advising financial sponsor clients. Earlier in his career, he worked in leveraged finance, bank lending, and private placements at Credit Suisse and J.P. Morgan.</p><p>Doug began his career at Manufacturers Hanover Trust Company and holds an A.B. from Princeton University and an M.B.A. from the Kellogg School of Management at Northwestern University.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="leaders-item w-dyn-item"><div class="leaders-item_wrap"><div class="leaders-img_wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b549619b8ccdce7d65c4_HarkCapital_Rafeal.avif" alt="" class="leader-img" width="200" height="300"><div class="leaders-icon_wrap is-mobile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="leaders_svg"><path d="M0.5 8H8M15.5 8H8M8 8V0.5M8 8V15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.763158"></path></svg></div></div><div class="leader-item_layout"><div class="leader_top u-text-style-large"><div class="leader-name">Rafael Castro</div><div class="leader_title u-text-style-main">Partner</div></div></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b549619b8ccdce7d65c4_HarkCapital_Rafeal.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Rafael Castro</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Partner</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Rafael Castro is a Partner at Bergweiss and has been with the firm since its inception. He leads the origination, execution, and portfolio management of the firmâ€™s investments.</p><p>Prior to Bergweiss, Rafael was a Managing Director at Velocity Capital Advisors and previously spent four years at Ableco Finance, managing a $450 million special situations loan portfolio. He also held roles at CIBC World Markets and J.P. Morganâ€™s LabMorgan group.</p><p>Rafael holds an A.B. from Harvard University and an M.B.A. from Columbia Business School.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="leaders-item w-dyn-item"><div class="leaders-item_wrap"><div class="leaders-img_wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b55b5eed67c14af94598_HarkCapital_Rich.avif" alt="" class="leader-img" width="200" height="300"><div class="leaders-icon_wrap is-mobile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="leaders_svg"><path d="M0.5 8H8M15.5 8H8M8 8V0.5M8 8V15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.763158"></path></svg></div></div><div class="leader-item_layout"><div class="leader_top u-text-style-large"><div class="leader-name">Rich Davis</div><div class="leader_title u-text-style-main">Partner</div></div></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b55b5eed67c14af94598_HarkCapital_Rich.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Rich Davis</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Partner</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Rich Davis is a Partner at Bergweiss and has been with the firm since its inception. He focuses on the origination, execution, and portfolio management of investments.</p><p>Previously, Rich was a Vice President at GarMark Partners, helping deploy a $330 million fund across private debt and equity. He also held roles at Wind Point Partners and RBC Capital Markets.</p><p>Rich holds a B.S. from the University of Illinois, an M.B.A. from the University of Chicago, and is a CFA charterholder.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="leaders-item w-dyn-item"><div class="leaders-item_wrap"><div class="leaders-img_wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b5671ae34837ba7682c7_HarkCapital_Ben.avif" alt="" class="leader-img" width="200" height="300"><div class="leaders-icon_wrap is-mobile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="leaders_svg"><path d="M0.5 8H8M15.5 8H8M8 8V0.5M8 8V15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.763158"></path></svg></div></div><div class="leader-item_layout"><div class="leader_top u-text-style-large"><div class="leader-name">Ben Lee</div><div class="leader_title u-text-style-main">Principal</div></div></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b5671ae34837ba7682c7_HarkCapital_Ben.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Ben Lee</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Principal</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Ben Lee is a Principal at Bergweiss and joined the firm in 2024. He is responsible for the origination, execution, and portfolio management of investments.</p><p>Prior to Bergweiss, Ben was a Director at Silicon Valley Bank and a founding member of the Structured Fund Solutions business, a multi-billion-dollar asset-backed fund financing platform. Earlier in his career, he held roles at Macquarie Group in fund finance in both New York and Sydney.</p><p>Ben holds a BCom (Finance) and a B.A. (Economics) from the University of Sydney.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="leaders-item w-dyn-item"><div class="leaders-item_wrap"><div class="leaders-img_wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b575890850180a395ed9_HarkCapital_Peter.avif" alt="" class="leader-img" width="200" height="300"><div class="leaders-icon_wrap is-mobile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="leaders_svg"><path d="M0.5 8H8M15.5 8H8M8 8V0.5M8 8V15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.763158"></path></svg></div></div><div class="leader-item_layout"><div class="leader_top u-text-style-large"><div class="leader-name">Peter Wright</div><div class="leader_title u-text-style-main">Director</div></div></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b575890850180a395ed9_HarkCapital_Peter.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Peter Wright</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Director</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Peter Wright is a Director at Bergweiss and joined the firm in 2024. He is responsible for investment origination.</p><p>Prior to Bergweiss, Peter was a Vice President at Devon Park Advisors, leading origination, execution, and syndication across a range of secondaries transactions, including LP interest acquisitions, GP-led restructurings, and strategic equity placements. Previously, he was a Senior Associate at Campbell Lutyens and an Associate at Stellex Capital Management.</p><p>Peter holds a B.B.A. from Howard University and an M.B.A. from the University of Chicago.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="leaders-item w-dyn-item"><div class="leaders-item_wrap"><div class="leaders-img_wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b59132da23faa82c89d5_HarkCapital_Diane.avif" alt="" class="leader-img" width="200" height="300"><div class="leaders-icon_wrap is-mobile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="leaders_svg"><path d="M0.5 8H8M15.5 8H8M8 8V0.5M8 8V15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.763158"></path></svg></div></div><div class="leader-item_layout"><div class="leader_top u-text-style-large"><div class="leader-name">Diane Moore</div><div class="leader_title u-text-style-main">Vice President</div></div></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b59132da23faa82c89d5_HarkCapital_Diane.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Diane Moore</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Vice President</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Diane Moore is a Vice President at Bergweiss and has been with the firm since 2020. She is responsible for execution and portfolio monitoring of Bergweissâ€™s investments.</p><p>Prior to joining Bergweiss, Diane worked on the Exchange-Traded Funds and Product teams at Aberdeen Standard Investments.</p><p>Diane holds a B.A. from Haverford College.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="leaders-item w-dyn-item"><div class="leaders-item_wrap"><div class="leaders-img_wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b5836100afadf884567a_HarkCapital_Will.avif" alt="" class="leader-img" width="200" height="300"><div class="leaders-icon_wrap is-mobile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="leaders_svg"><path d="M0.5 8H8M15.5 8H8M8 8V0.5M8 8V15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.763158"></path></svg></div></div><div class="leader-item_layout"><div class="leader_top u-text-style-large"><div class="leader-name">Will Randell</div><div class="leader_title u-text-style-main">Vice President</div></div></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b5836100afadf884567a_HarkCapital_Will.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Will Randell</div><div class="team-item-popup-ti