ontent-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Alex Bockler</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">CFO &amp; CCO</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Alex Bockler is the Chief Financial Officer and Chief Compliance Officer of Bergweiss. He is responsible for finance, accounting, tax, operations and compliance across the Bergweiss funds.</p><p>Prior to joining Bergweiss, Alex supported the platform while at Aberdeen Standard Investments. Earlier in his career, he was a Senior Associate in the Private Bank at J.P. Morgan in New York, where he led audits and operations for a range of investment products, including direct private equity funds, fund of funds, and hedge funds. He began his career at BNY Mellon as an accountant for publicly traded 1940 Act funds. </p><p>Alex holds a B.S. from La Salle University.</p><p>â€</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="leaders-item w-dyn-item"><div class="leaders-item_wrap"><div class="leaders-img_wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b5c5d7e1408566aba3a2_HarkCapital_Ronak.avif" alt="" class="leader-img" width="200" height="300"><div class="leaders-icon_wrap is-mobile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="leaders_svg"><path d="M0.5 8H8M15.5 8H8M8 8V0.5M8 8V15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.763158"></path></svg></div></div><div class="leader-item_layout"><div class="leader_top u-text-style-large"><div class="leader-name">Ronak Patel</div><div class="leader_title u-text-style-main">Controller</div></div></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/68c2b5c5d7e1408566aba3a2_HarkCapital_Ronak.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Ronak Patel</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Controller</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Ronak Patel is the Controller at Bergweiss and joined the firm in 2023. He is responsible for finance, accounting, tax, and operations across the Bergweiss funds.</p><p>Prior to Bergweiss, Ronak was the Controller at Monachil Capital Partners, where he oversaw finance and operations for the firmâ€™s private debt and â€™40 Act funds. Before that, he served as Head of Finance at Antlerâ€™s U.S. venture fund. Earlier in his career, he held roles at The Beekman Group and SS&amp;C Technologies.</p><p>Ronak holds an M.S. in Accounting and a B.B.A. in Finance from Pace University.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div><div team-item="" role="listitem" class="leaders-item w-dyn-item"><div class="leaders-item_wrap"><div class="leaders-img_wrap"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/6888b10ecd7599e3d3d4064c_Caitlin%20Hilmer.avif" alt="" class="leader-img"><div class="leaders-icon_wrap is-mobile"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke" class="leaders_svg"><path d="M0.5 8H8M15.5 8H8M8 8V0.5M8 8V15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.763158"></path></svg></div></div><div class="leader-item_layout"><div class="leader_top u-text-style-large"><div class="leader-name">Caitlin Hilmer</div><div class="leader_title u-text-style-main">Executive Assistant</div></div></div><div class="team-popup_wrap"><div team-close="" class="team-popup_bg"></div><div class="team-item-layout"><div class="team-item_img_contain"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68833cb78bbecd4524b8ed48/6888b10ecd7599e3d3d4064c_Caitlin%20Hilmer.avif" alt="" class="team-img"></div><div class="team-item_content_layout"><div data-lenis-prevent="" class="team-item_content-inner" style="opacity: 0;"><div class="team-item-popup_header"><div class="team-item-popup_name u-text-style-main">Caitlin Hilmer</div><div class="team-item-popup-title u-text-style-small">Executive Assistant</div></div><div class="team-item-popup_body"><div class="leaders-rich w-richtext"><p>Caitlin Hilmer is an Executive Assistant at Bergweiss and has been with the firm since 2023. She is responsible for administrative support, coordinating travel, managing team calendars, and assisting with various operational functions.</p><p>Prior to joining Bergweiss, Caitlin managed one of the highest-producing dental practices in Wisconsin for a growing dental services organization, where she developed strong operational and team management skills. Earlier in her career, she was a board-certified veterinary technician, providing care across large, small, and exotic animal practices.</p></div></div></div><div team-close="" class="team-close"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 11 11" fill="none" class="team-close_svg"><path d="M9.75722 1.24261L1.26896 9.72892M1.27005 1.24473L9.75534 9.73002" stroke="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><